=== REASONING ===
- Widget uses two hooks: useTeslaEnergySites to discover site IDs, useTeslaEnergySiteInfo for detail.
- WidgetDetailCard handles compact mode (slices to 4 entries), empty state, row layout.
- Four KV rows: Solar System (kW), Powerwalls (count × kWh), Gateway Firmware (mono), Installation Timezone.
- nameplate_power and nameplate_energy are in watts/watt-hours → divide by 1000 for kW/kWh.
- No unit conversions needed (kW/kWh are universal energy units, not distance/temp/speed/pressure).
- Compact mode handled by passing compact=true to WidgetDetailCard.

